notes.notes:
We will update the version on 24/06/2020 1:50 p.m (GMT-7). Players need to re-download the game client before they can continue the game. The contents of this update are as follows:

New content:
1: After this update, the gamepad will be supported;
2: The weapon spear will continuous damage when hold mouse left;
3: Throwing grenade action optimization;
4: AI performance optimization and behavior logic optimization;
5: The range of the climb can be increased;
6: The displacement of the character's dive in water increases
7: When the character is at the bottom of the water, add the particle effect of blisters;
8: The katana‘s ’shift+attack animation replacement;
9: Change the katana‘s lansquenet skill animation;
10: The samurai skill of the katana increased to 7 attack animation;
11: Try to play the camera shake to all players when the treasure is generated and each tsunami comes;
12: The performance of the minor hit is optimized, and the action range becomes larger;
13: Caught in the front of the hook, it can be freed within 10 frames

Bug fix:
1: Repair the wrong posture when running with the weapon spear to the right;
2: Fixed an issue when PoDao use lansquenet skill would be interrupted;
3: Fixed the 4th attack animation strength value of the Shichishito, which can now only cause a medium-hit to the target.
